<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMP said cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMP said cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney lowered its recommendation on AMP Inc to neutral from buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were untraded early Thursday due to an order imbalance, but where bid sharply lower at 33-1/4, offered at 34-1/2. The stock closed Wednesday at 38-1/4.</p>
</text>
